				<p>outside of work i like messing around with different kinds of systems and doing questionable experiments with emacs. lately i've been focusing on ai infra, cuz our fellow ai is getting more and more interesting.</p>
				<p>you can find out more about what i'm doing in <a href="/projects" class="ulink">projects</a> or on <a href="https://github.com/yuann3" class="ulink">my github</a>, though some things never go public (yeah, purely cuz i forget to).</p>
